@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' Adapted from reviewed presentation sources: W3-10/11/12/12a/13/13a; retry identity and independent stale fences
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam ClassStereotypeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 24
hide footbox
hide circle
title UC-4 · retry, replay and late completion
autonumber
actor Owner
control RetryControl as R
entity ProcessingJob as J
boundary Encoder as E
Owner -> R : retry failed asset with request identity
R -> R : check ownership and request replay
alt replay
 R --> Owner : prior accepted retry
else wrong owner / unavailable asset / wrong state
 R --> Owner : refuse; no new attempt
else eligible failed job
 R -> R : retain retry intent over stored source
 R --> Owner : retry accepted
 R -> J : apply request under job authority
 alt request already applied
  J --> R : current attempt; no successor
 else first eligible request
  J -> J : create new numbered attempt; retain work
  J --> R : new current attempt
 end
 J -> E : deliver successor work
 opt old worker returns late
  E -> J : finish using old execution authority
  J --> E : refuse stale completion
 end
end
note over R,J : A reordered retry waits for submission;\nsource bytes are not uploaded again.
@enduml
